<Document>
  <name>San Jacinto County — Unmapped Historical Markers</name>
  <description>THC markers in San Jacinto County without an HMDB id (isMissing excluded). 9 with THC coords; 0 geocoded from address; 1 omitted (no usable address). Orange pins are isPending=True — the marker may not be installed yet.</description>
